sequenceDiagram
  participant U as User
  participant C as React client
  participant S as Express API
  participant M as MongoDB
  participant P as PDFKit

  U->>C: Click Prescription PDF
  C->>S: GET /api/patients/id/prescription.pdf
  S->>M: find patient
  M-->>S: document
  S->>P: build PDF
  P-->>S: PDF stream
  S-->>C: application/pdf
  C-->>U: Download
